OL,3,GNEWSAHow a dashcam clue cracked drugs
OL,4,Aambush case
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhen a 17-year-old boy was found left
OL,7,Ffor dead under a railway bridge with
OL,8,Ftraumatic brain injuries, police
OL,9,Foriginally thought he was the victim of
OL,10,Fa hit-and-run.
OL,12,FMedical examinations later found he had
OL,13,Fno other injuries - instead pointing
OL,14,Ftowards an attack. The boy survived but
OL,15,Fhad life-changing injuries.
OL,17,FNow a detective who led the
OL,18,Finvestigation into the attack in Luton
OL,19,Fin June 2022 has told a documentary
OL,20,Fthat getting the key breakthrough was
OL,21,Flike "scoring a goal in the Premier
OL,22,FLeague".
OL,23,APub: 06-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
