OL,3,GNEWSAHow a dashcam clue cracked drugs
OL,4,Aambush case
OL,5,
OL,6,FFormer Det Sgt Tom Hamm, who worked for
OL,7,FBedfordshire Police, told the BBC: "It
OL,8,Fis not unprofessional to take joy from
OL,9,Fhaving a hit."
